# cli_disarm_rc_armed_flying.expect — the CLI `disarm` stops a craft that the transmitter armed and flies in STABILIZE, at once
# 送信機で ARM して STABILIZE で飛ぶ機体を、CLI の `disarm` がすぐ止める
#
exit 0
log_contains any "ARM accepted"
log_contains any "Takeoff complete"
log_contains any "ok: motors stopped (state FLYING -> IDLE_GROUND)"
log_contains any "DISARM accepted (FLYING → IDLE_GROUND)"
log_absent any "auto-land (LANDING)"
# Order inside the firmware log (stderr).
# ファームのログ（stderr）の中の順序。
order "ARM accepted" "Takeoff complete"
order "Takeoff complete" "DISARM accepted (FLYING → IDLE_GROUND)"
# The motors turn while flying (before about 8.5 s) and are stopped from the CLI DISARM on, although the transmitter still holds the throttle.
# 飛行中（約 8.5 s まで）はモータが回り、CLI の DISARM 以降は、送信機がスロットルを保持していても止まっている。
metric duty_max > 0.3 in 7.0 8.4
metric duty_max < 0.01 in 9.2 10.5
